ind":"announcement","title":"Bug Fixes & Rescue Cargo","summary":"Thanks to everyone who played and left feedback! A new update for the demo is live. Fixes General bug fixes. We squashed a number of small bugs that were getting in the way of play. No more getting stuck. If your credits drop below 50 and nothing on offer is affordable, a one-time rescue cargo priced under your wallet arrives right away. No more waiting around or restarting your save. Clearer costs. The freedom bar at the top now shows costs as 10x plus the material's icon instead of letters lik","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:20:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029928","verified_at":"2026-10-21T20:56:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5132810-1847286114029914","game_id":"steam-5132810","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest Live #2: Fresh Fixes & Rescue Cargo","summary":"We're streaming the Sector Zero: Freedom demo live for Steam Next Fest!Watch us sort scrap, stack huge piles, chain big combos and work our way from slave to citizen. Drop by the chat and ask us anything about the game.The free demo is available right now. If you enjoy it, adding Sector Zero: Freedom to your wishlist really helps a small studio like ours!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:16:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029914","verified_at":"2026-10-21T20:56:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5132810-1846651706691551","game_id":"steam-5132810","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest Live: Sorting Scrap & Chasing Combos","summary":"We're streaming the Sector Zero: Freedom demo live for Steam Next Fest!Watch us sort scrap, stack huge piles, chain big combos and work our way from slave to citizen. Drop by the chat and ask us anything about the game.The free demo is available right now. If you enjoy it, adding Sector Zero: Freedom to your wishlist really helps a small studio like ours!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:05:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691551","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:09:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5132810-1846651706687831","game_id":"steam-5132810","kind":"update","title":"Next Fest Update","summary":"Thanks to everyone who played and left feedback! Here's what changed for the Steam Next Fest demo: Fixes Fullscreen no longer gets stuck. Switching from fullscreen to windowed could leave the game shrunk inside a black screen. Fixed, and the window now fits smaller screens too. New shortcut: press F11 or Alt+Enter at any time to toggle fullscreen. Fewer interruptions while sorting. Throwing a pile into a bin no longer pops up a message every time. The floating +items / +credits numbers still sho","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T19:25:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687831","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:09:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5132810-1846651706681390","game_id":"steam-5132810","kind":"announcement","title":"Improvements and Some Changes","summary":"HOTFIX UPDATE – Gameplay Improvements & Tutorial ChangesWe've made a few improvements to make the gameplay experience smoother and the tutorial easier to follow!🔧 Changes & ImprovementsPaused Conveyor During Tutorials: The conveyor will now stop while tutorial instructions are being displayed, giving you more time to read and understand them without pressure.Inspector Voss Introduction: When Inspector Voss first arrives, players will now receive an explanation of why he's here and when his visit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:01:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681390","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:09:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5132810":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:44:31Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:44:30Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5132810":"2026-10-26T08:44:31Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5132810":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:44:30Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:44:30Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:44:30Z"},"5290280":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:44:31Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:44:31Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:44:31Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5132810","app_id":5132810,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:34Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"dded9edb700f3ca228fcf2716ba09caac1e923ed591e2379996fae0de3be8e73","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"제국의 노예로 일하며 자신의 사업을 세우고, 감독을 견뎌내고, 노동조합에 가입하고, 자유를 사는 SF 인크리멘탈 시뮬레이션.","publishers":[{"name":"Shift Orbit Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"Shift Orbit Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"SECTOR ZERO: FREEDOM OFFICIAL TRAILER","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792952001","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"5132810/2113805636/13